## 导入规范

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import {
  DasSearchBar,
  DasTable,
  DasMetricCard,
  DasDetail,
  DasTabs,
  DasFormGroup,
  DasEmpty,
  DasAlert,
  DasBadge,
  DasTag,
  DasDrawer,
} from 'das-component-vue'
import { message } from 'ant-design-vue'
</script>
```

